Every night, Diago redraws the trendlines
on 2,259 stocks.

5
00:00:17,700 --> 00:00:21,600
When a price breaks its diagonal —
Diago catches it.

6
00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:24,300
You get one alert.

7
00:00:24,500 --> 00:00:28,200
One score — built from
72,000 historical setups.

8
00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,800
Six means decent. Ten means rare.

9
00:00:31,300 --> 00:00:33,200
It works on support too.

10
00:00:33,400 --> 00:00:36,300
Price falls to its rising line,
holds — and bounces.

11
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,000
Diago's strongest setup.

12
00:00:38,500 --> 00:00:41,300
Diago. Seven days free — no card.
Then five dollars a month.

13
